export anchor TerritoryMapStyle:
    number: 339
    screen: CrmPipeline
    name: Territory map
    idea: The pipeline placed on a dark abstract map of five sales regions, where each deal is a numbered pin whose shape tells its state, with a keyed deal list beside the map as the legend and text version.
    base: dark
    palette:
        sea: #08121c, the page and the style sheet
        chartSea: #0b1826, water inside the map
        land: #13243a, region fills, stepped from #112238 to #182e47
        panel: #0f1c2b, the map frame, fields and row hover
        border: #2e4a68, region borders, rules and dashed dividers
        ink: #e3ecf6, text
        muted: #9fb6cf, region names, labels and the compass
        amber: #ffc86b, pins, the target hatch and primary button
        onAmber: #1d1300, pin numbers and button text
        coral: #ff8f7a, Stalled and its triangle pin
        mint: #8de0b5, Won and its ringed pin
        ice: #9cd3ff, the secondary button, note icons and focus
    type:
        A condensed stack, Bahnschrift, DIN Alternate, Roboto Condensed,
        Arial Narrow, Segoe UI. Base 15px. The title is 26px at 700,
        figures 24px at 700 with tabular numbers, region names on the map
        20px uppercase tracked .15em, deal names 15px at 700, meta 13px.
    layout:
        A thin top bar holds a pin icon with Brightwork Sales Territories,
        an All stages outline button and an amber Place deal button. The
        title Q4 pipeline by territory sits over a ruled band of five
        figures split by dashed lines, the won figure with a hatched amber
        bar at 64 percent. Below, a wide map frame takes about two thirds
        of the width. It shows five invented regions, North, Harbour,
        Central, East and South, as dark polygons with dashed contour lines
        and a small compass, and seven numbered pins. Lumen Bakery and
        Saltwater Freight sit in Harbour, Orbit Labs and Northpass in North,
        Kettle and Co in Central, Fernhill Studio in East and Bluewater
        Clinics in South. Under the map sit a shape legend and a note that
        regions are not to scale. The right column, Deals on the map, lists
        pins 1 to 7 with the same pin shape, the deal, region, stage, owner,
        status and value. Field notes holds the activity below. Below 960px
        the list drops under the map.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 20px between map and list, 10px row padding, 24px gutter, 16px on phones.
    density: Medium. The map carries placement and the keyed list carries the detail.
    corners: 6px map frame, 4px buttons and fields, round pins, teardrop swatches.
    borders: 2px region borders, 1px rules under every list row, dashed contours and summary dividers.
    shadows: None. Pins sit on a 3px sea coloured ring so they lift off the land.
    icons:
        Line icons at 1.9 stroke in the chrome. On the map pin shape
        carries state, a circle for open, a diamond for a booked date, a
        square for sent, a triangle for stalled and a ringed circle for won.
    focus: A 2px dashed ice outline offset 3px.
    tone: Field and survey words, such as Territories, Place deal, Deals on the map and Field notes.
